## DeskHelper Pro 1.3.10

**Improvements**
- **Key & Button Remapping** — a held remapped key now repeats its output like a physical key, and holding another key while tapping a dual-role (tap/hold) key no longer swallows the tap.
- **Menu buttons** — longer button labels shrink to fit instead of getting cut off with an ellipsis.

